{{!< agency}}
<main id="top" class="tla">

  {{!-- HERO: short gold band, slanted white panel, framed image --}}
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-panel">
        <h1 id="hero-h">{{@custom.hero_headline}}</h1>
        {{#if @custom.hero_intro}}<p class="lede">{{@custom.hero_intro}}</p>{{/if}}
        <div class="ctas">
          <a class="btn dark" href="{{#if @custom.booking_link}}{{@custom.booking_link}}{{else}}mailto:learning.agency@ucdenver.edu?subject=Free%20project%20plan{{/if}}">{{@custom.cta_label}} <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="link" href="#cost">See what it costs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-media">
        {{#if @site.cover_image}}
        <img src="{{img_url @site.cover_image size="l"}}" alt="" fetchpriority="high">
        {{else}}
        <div class="ph"><span class="pv">Preview: add a photo as the Publication cover (Settings → General)</span></div>
        {{/if}}
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- FINDER: CU's "Where will your future take you?" as a conversation starter --}}
  <section class="finder" aria-labelledby="finder-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="finder-copy">
        <h2 id="finder-h">Where Will Your Project Take You?</h2>
        <p>Tell us a little about what you need. It starts an email to the Agency, and we'll set up a time to map out your free project plan.</p>
      </div>
      <form id="finder" class="finder-form">
        <label>I'm with
          <select name="who">
            <option value="">Select</option>
            <option>A nonprofit or community organization</option>
            <option>A company or L&amp;D team</option>
            <option>A school or district</option>
            <option>A college or university</option>
            <option>SEHD faculty or a program</option>
            <option>Agency alumni</option>
            <option>Just me</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>I need help with
          <select name="what">
            <option value="">Select</option>
            <option>A course in Canvas or another LMS</option>
            <option>E-learning or training modules</option>
            <option>Video or a podcast</option>
            <option>Hosting a course or training</option>
            <option>Going digital in general</option>
            <option>I'm not sure yet</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>Timing
          <select name="when">
            <option value="">Select</option>
            <option>As soon as possible</option>
            <option>In the next few months</option>
            <option>Just exploring</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button class="btn dark" type="submit">Start <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- AT A GLANCE --}}
  <section class="glance" aria-labelledby="glance-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="glance-h">The Agency at a Glance</h2>
      <ul class="stats">
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7h22v14H14l-6 5v-5H5z"/><path d="M11 13h10M11 17h6"/></svg>
          <b>Free Plan</b><span>A no-pressure hour with Brad Hinson, the Agency's director, to map out your project.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="11"/><path d="M16 9v14M20 12.5c-.8-1.2-2.2-1.8-4-1.8-2.3 0-3.8 1.1-3.8 2.7 0 3.8 7.8 2 7.8 5.8 0 1.7-1.6 2.9-4 2.9-1.9 0-3.4-.7-4.2-2"/></svg>
          <b>$40</b><span>Per hour after that. Buy a block of hours; they stay banked until you use them.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="4"/><circle cx="22" cy="11" r="4"/><path d="M4 26c0-4 3-7 7-7s7 3 7 7M15 26c0-4 3-7 7-7s7 3 7 7"/></svg>
          <b>2 Helpers</b><span>On every project: a graduate student, and the faculty member guiding them.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 27h24M7 27V13l9-6 9 6v14M12 27v-7h8v7"/><path d="M11 15h2M19 15h2"/></svg>
          <b>13+</b><span>Partner organizations, from the Colorado Department of Education to CU Anschutz.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- FIRST HOUR: CU's testimonial slot, used for the human face of the Agency --}}
  <section class="feature" id="plan" aria-labelledby="fh-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="feature-copy">
        <svg class="qmark" viewBox="0 0 48 36" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 36V22C0 9 7 2 19 0l2 5c-7 2-10 6-10 12h9v19zm27 0V22C27 9 34 2 46 0l2 5c-7 2-10 6-10 12h9v19z"/></svg>
        <h2 id="fh-h">You teach them the work. They teach you the tools.</h2>
        <p>Every project starts with a free project plan: an hour with Brad Hinson, the Agency's director and a faculty member in Learning Design &amp; Technology, to map out what you need. Bring your idea, your questions, or just the feeling that you're in over your head. No strings attached.</p>
        <a class="link" href="{{#if @custom.booking_link}}{{@custom.booking_link}}{{else}}mailto:learning.agency@ucdenver.edu?subject=Free%20project%20plan{{/if}}">Get your {{@custom.cta_label}} <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="feature-media">
        {{#if @custom.director_photo}}
        <img src="{{img_url @custom.director_photo size="m"}}" alt="Brad Hinson, Director" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption><b>Brad Hinson</b> Director, Student Agency · Faculty, Learning Design &amp; Technology</figcaption>
        {{else}}
        <div class="ph portrait"><span class="pv">Preview: add Director photo (Design → Theme)</span></div>
        {{/if}}
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- EXPERIENCE CARDS --}}
  <section class="experience" aria-labelledby="exp-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="row-head">
        <h2 id="exp-h">The Agency Experience</h2>
        <p>Help with the work, and the know-how to keep it going.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        <a class="xcard" href="#services">
          <div class="xart a1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="xbody"><h3>Get Help With a Project</h3><p>Courses, e-learning, video, and podcasts, built with you by a graduate student and their faculty mentor.</p><span class="more">Learn More <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div>
        </a>
        <a class="xcard" href="#services">
          <div class="xart a2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="xbody"><h3>Host Your Course or Training</h3><p>We can run your workshop or academy in Canvas and keep your e-learning online, so you don't have to.</p><span class="more">Learn More <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div>
        </a>
        <a class="xcard" href="{{@site.url}}/students/">
          <div class="xart a3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="xbody"><h3>Learn by Doing</h3><p>For CU Denver LDT students: real clients, real tools, course credit, and a community that lasts.</p><span class="more">For Students <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- SERVICES (editable: home-services) --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:home-services" limit="1"}}{{#foreach pages}}
  <section id="services" class="ed ed-services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>{{title}}</h2>{{#if custom_excerpt}}<p>{{custom_excerpt}}</p>{{/if}}</div>
      <div class="sec-body">{{content}}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/foreach}}{{else}}
  <section id="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>What We Help With</h2><p>Bring us a course to build, a training to produce, or an academy that needs a home. Take any piece on its own, or hand us the whole thing.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-grid">
        <div class="svc-col">
          <h3>Build &amp; Produce</h3>
          <dl>
            <dt>Courses in Canvas</dt><dd>New courses, rebuilt courses, and the polish that makes an existing course easier to teach and take.</dd>
            <dt>E-learning and microlearning</dt><dd>Self-paced modules and short pieces people can finish between meetings, in Articulate Rise and Storyline.</dd>
            <dt>Video and podcasts</dt><dd>Scripted explainers, screen recordings, edited lecture video, and podcasts.</dd>
            <dt>Learning experience design</dt><dd>Figuring out what people need to learn, and the shape of the course, before anything gets built.</dd>
            <dt>Grant support</dt><dd>Learning and evaluation pieces for grant proposals and funded projects.</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-col">
          <h3>Host &amp; Maintain</h3>
          <dl>
            <dt>Canvas hosting</dt><dd>We host your workshop, course, or academy in Canvas and run it for you.</dd>
            <dt>E-learning hosting</dt><dd>Your Rise modules stay online, with participation and completion tracking.</dd>
            <dt>Video and podcast publishing</dt><dd>Your library on YouTube or Wistia; your podcast on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, and the rest.</dd>
            <dt>Learning to run it yourself</dt><dd>When the project is done, we show you how to keep it going.</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/get}}

  {{!-- COST --}}
  <section id="cost" class="cost" aria-labelledby="cost-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2 id="cost-h">What It Costs</h2><p>Start with a free project plan. Pay only for the hours your project uses.</p></div>
      <div class="cost-grid">
        <ul class="tiers">
          <li class="free"><span>Project plan</span><b>Free</b><small>An hour with Brad to map out your project. No strings attached.</small></li>
          <li><span>SEHD faculty &amp; programs</span><b>No cost</b><small>Design, redesign, or media for your course.</small></li>
          <li><span>Agency alumni who mentor</span><b>No cost</b><small>Bring a project, mentor the student we assign.</small></li>
          <li><span>Hosting</span><b>Scoped per project</b><small>We'll talk it through as part of your project plan.</small></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="est" data-rate="40">
          <p class="est-k">Project assistance</p>
          <p class="est-rate"><b>$40</b> per hour</p>
          <label for="est-hours" class="est-l"><span>Size a block of hours</span><span><b id="est-h">40</b> hours = <b id="est-total">$1,600</b></span></label>
          <input id="est-hours" type="range" min="10" max="120" step="5" value="40">
          <p class="est-note">Hours are bought through the CU Denver storefront and stay banked until your project uses them.</p>
          <a class="btn dark" href="https://secure.touchnet.net/C20369_ustores/web/product_detail.jsp?PRODUCTID=514">Buy Project Hours <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- HOW IT WORKS (editable: home-how) --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:home-how" limit="1"}}{{#foreach pages}}
  <section id="how" class="ed ed-how tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>{{title}}</h2>{{#if custom_excerpt}}<p>{{custom_excerpt}}</p>{{/if}}</div>
      <div class="sec-body">{{content}}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/foreach}}{{else}}
  <section id="how" class="tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>How It Works</h2><p>A partnership, not a purchase. You get help; a future learning designer gets a start.</p></div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3>Talk with Brad</h3><p>Your free project plan. Tell us what you need and when, and we'll help you map it out.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Get matched</h3><p>We pair you with the graduate student whose skills fit your project best.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Work together</h3><p>Remote and mostly asynchronous, with check-ins by video call. Your student has a faculty mentor behind them the whole way.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Keep it going</h3><p>When the work is done, you'll know how to run it, update it, and grow it.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="expect">
        <h3>What we ask of you</h3>
        <p>Patience and direction. Your student is a working professional in training: part-time, remote, and learning on the job. You guide the work; they bring the tools and the training of CU Denver's Learning Design &amp; Technology program.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/get}}

  {{!-- PARTNERS (editable: home-partners) --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:home-partners" limit="1"}}{{#foreach pages}}
  <section id="who" class="ed ed-who">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>{{title}}</h2>{{#if custom_excerpt}}<p>{{custom_excerpt}}</p>{{/if}}</div>
      <div class="sec-body">{{content}}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/foreach}}{{/get}}

  {{!-- WORK: CU's "Recent News" row, from posts tagged #work --}}
{{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-work" limit="4" include="tags"}}
  <section id="work" class="work">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="row-head"><h2>Our Work</h2></div>
      <div class="news">
        {{#foreach posts}}
        <a class="ncard" href="{{url}}">
          <div class="nimg">{{#if feature_image}}<img src="{{img_url feature_image size="m"}}" alt="{{#if feature_image_alt}}{{feature_image_alt}}{{else}}{{title}}{{/if}}" loading="lazy">{{/if}}</div>
          <h3>{{title}}</h3>
          {{#if primary_tag}}<p class="ntag">{{primary_tag.name}}</p>{{/if}}
        </a>
        {{/foreach}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{else}}
  <section id="work" class="work">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="row-head"><h2>Our Work</h2><span class="pv">Preview: publish posts tagged #work to fill this row</span></div>
      <div class="news">
        <div class="ncard"><div class="nimg"></div><h3>Hosted onboarding academy for a statewide agency</h3><p class="ntag">Canvas · Hosting</p></div>
        <div class="ncard"><div class="nimg"></div><h3>Course redesign with an SEHD professor</h3><p class="ntag">Canvas · Media</p></div>
        <div class="ncard"><div class="nimg"></div><h3>Rise training series for a corporate client</h3><p class="ntag">Articulate Rise</p></div>
        <div class="ncard"><div class="nimg"></div><h3>Podcast launch for a nonprofit</h3><p class="ntag">Podcast</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/get}}

  {{!-- CLIENTS (editable: home-clients) --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:home-clients" limit="1"}}{{#foreach pages}}
  <section id="clients" class="ed ed-clients">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>{{title}}</h2>{{#if custom_excerpt}}<p>{{custom_excerpt}}</p>{{/if}}</div>
      <div class="sec-body">{{content}}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/foreach}}{{else}}
  <section id="clients">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Who We've Worked With</h2></div>
      <ul class="clients">
        <li>Academic Impressions</li><li>Apple Education</li><li>Colorado Department of Education</li><li>Colorado Office of Employment First</li><li>Colorado School of Public Health</li><li>CU Anschutz Medical Campus</li><li>CU Boulder</li><li>CU Denver</li><li>Lived X</li><li>Savory Global</li><li>St. Vrain Valley Schools Innovation Center</li><li>Visually Impaired Preschool Services</li><li>World Trade Center Denver</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/get}}

  {{!-- FAQ (editable: home-faq) --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:home-faq" limit="1"}}{{#foreach pages}}
  <section id="faq" class="ed ed-faq tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>{{title}}</h2>{{#if custom_excerpt}}<p>{{custom_excerpt}}</p>{{/if}}</div>
      <div class="sec-body">{{content}}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/foreach}}{{else}}
  <section id="faq" class="tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Questions</h2></div>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>Who will actually do the work?</summary><p>A graduate student in CU Denver's Learning Design &amp; Technology program, enrolled in the INTE 6930 internship, with a faculty member guiding them. You're their client and, in a real sense, their mentor.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What's the free project plan?</summary><p>An hour with Brad Hinson to talk through your project: what you need, what's possible, and whether the Agency is a good fit. No commitment.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What does it cost after that?</summary><p>$40 per hour for project assistance, bought as a block of hours through the CU Denver storefront. Hours stay banked until your project uses them. Projects with SEHD faculty and programs, and with Agency alumni who mentor, are free. Hosting is scoped per project.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will I be able to maintain it myself?</summary><p>That's part of the point. Your student will show you how to run, update, and grow what you've built together.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/get}}

  {{!-- COMMUNITY BAND --}}
  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="band-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="band-panel">
        <div>
          <h2 id="band-h">Once Agency, Always Agency.</h2>
          <p>Our students become graduates, then mentors, then the people who send the next project our way. Join a community that keeps learning together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="band-btns">
          <a class="btn dark wide" href="{{#if @custom.booking_link}}{{@custom.booking_link}}{{else}}mailto:learning.agency@ucdenver.edu?subject=Free%20project%20plan{{/if}}">{{@custom.cta_label}} <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="btn dark wide" href="https://secure.touchnet.net/C20369_ustores/web/product_detail.jsp?PRODUCTID=514">Buy Project Hours <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="btn dark wide" href="{{@site.url}}/students/">For LDT Students <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
